        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-stance-p10-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "明明 + proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "明明 treats a fact as obvious while challenging an inconsistent claim. This can sound accusatory, so consider the relationship and evidence.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你明明知道，为什么不说？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ míngmíng zhīdào ， wèishénme bù shuō ？",
                "meaning": "You clearly know, so why do you not say?",
                "audio": "3aed92447a04308d220d50be5d1886f34ae1ffa4fc4825569c224142547bed92"
              },
              {
                "text": "他明明在家，却说不在。",
                "pinyin": "tā míngmíng zài jiā ， què shuō bù zài 。",
                "meaning": "He is plainly at home, yet says he is not.",
                "audio": "0ccd941ea83934dfa5cdd93a0b7f3c24589728df334b42a51e4dce5dac9c7ad6"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
